                  "blocks": {
                    "text_PTcXkW": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "name": "t:names.text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>We have a 60-day return policy so you can return them for any reason. In addition, we have a 90-day materials warranty policy for toe spacers that split during use.</p><p>We will ship you an exchange or replacement product to you free of charge. </p><p>If you are between sizes, you may purchase both the smaller and larger size and then return the pair that does not fit. </p><p>Please note that the initial shipping costs are non-refundable. Any cost associated with shipping a product back to Correct Toes will be the responsibility of the customer.</p><p>Read full<strong> </strong><a href=\"/pages/returns-exchanges\" title=\"Returns & Exchanges\"><strong>policy here</strong></a><strong>.</strong></p>",
